---
// WhatIDo.astro
---

<section class="section section--sm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="label" data-i18n="what_label">What I Do</div>
    <h2 class="section-title mt-3" data-i18n="what_title">From raw data to business clarity</h2>

    <ul class="what-list">
      <li class="what-item">
        <span class="what-icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="1 8 5 12 15 4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span data-i18n="what_1">Understand the business problem before touching the data</span>
      </li>
      <li class="what-item">
        <span class="what-icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="1 8 5 12 15 4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span data-i18n="what_2">Clean and structure messy, inconsistent datasets</span>
      </li>
      <li class="what-item">
        <span class="what-icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="1 8 5 12 15 4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span data-i18n="what_3">Build dashboards that decision-makers actually use</span>
      </li>
      <li class="what-item">
        <span class="what-icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="1 8 5 12 15 4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span data-i18n="what_4">Surface patterns, anomalies, and insights that matter</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mt-3 {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .what-list {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .what-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--clr-text);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .what-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    background: var(--clr-accent-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--clr-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }
</style>
